invalid type: string "Bridgerton is a period tv show that follows the lives of the Bridgerton family. \nThe family consists of 8 children and matriarch, Violet. \nThe 8 children include: \n- Anthony: Viscount, oldest of the 8, married to Kate Sharma (Season 2)\n- Benedict: Second oldest, lover of the arts, married to Sophie Park (Season 4)\n- Colin: traveler, married to Penelope Featherington (Sea